OL,3,GNEWSASunny day? The book that catches
OL,4,Achildren's feelings using weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of primary school pupils have
OL,7,Fcome together to turn their ideas about
OL,8,Ffeelings and emotions into a book
OL,9,Fdesigned to help young people
OL,10,Funderstand their mental health.
OL,12,FThe Weather Catcher was co-created by
OL,13,FYear Six pupils from Glencraig
OL,14,FIntegrated Primary School and Holywood
OL,15,FPrimary school, using weather to help
OL,16,Fchildren understand that feelings can
OL,17,Fchange from day to day.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
