OL,3,GNEWSASunny day? The book that catches
OL,4,Achildren's feelings using weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FThrough a series of workshops organised
OL,7,Fby Action Mental Health, Illustrator
OL,8,FEllan Rankin guided the children to use
OL,9,Fcolours, shapes and textures to
OL,10,Frepresent their emotions.
OL,12,FThe book is being launched on Love Your
OL,13,FLibrary Day which coincides with Book
OL,14,FWeek NI.
